docs {
  Confirmed live 2026-09-08 against a throwaway `type: "Static"` list,
  since deleted. `openapi_pimv3.json` declares no `PATCH`/`DELETE` for
  this resource; both work anyway (`PATCH` rename -- `200`; `DELETE` --
  `204`, then `404` on GET) -- same pattern as every resource tested this
  project.
}
